# A working copy of the Educational SVG drawings, if one is checked out beside
# the plugin. The drawings belong to DynoDS/educational-svg and are fetched as
# they are chosen; committing them here would put 135,610 files into this
# repository's history permanently, and every plugin install would download
# them for ever after, whether or not they were still in the folder.
/educational-svg/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
